{"info": {"address1": "Natraj by Rustomjee", "address2": "Office No. 602, 6th Floor Near Western Express Highway 194, Sir Mathuradas Vasanji Rd, Andheri (E)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400069", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6650 9999", "fax": "91 22 6650 9800", "website": "https://www.nfil.in", "industry": "Chemicals", "industryKey": "chemicals", "industryDisp": "Chemicals", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "Navin Fluorine International Limited manufactures and sells specialty fluorochemicals in India and internationally. The company offers refrigerants for various applications, including window and split room air conditioners, chillers, packaged air conditioners, commercial and industrial refrigeration units, intermediate for active pharmaceutical ingredients, fluoropolymer resins, domestic and industrial refrigerators, and mobile air conditioning under the Mafron brand for original equipment manufacturer, service technicians, and equipment owners. It also provides inorganic fluoride products, such as ammonium bifluoride, potassium fluoride, sodium fluoride, potassium fluorotitanate, potassium fluoroborate, hexafluorophosphoric acid, and hydrofluo pyridine and hydrofluo urea complex products for oil and gas, stainless steel, pharmaceutical and agrochemicals, abrasives, electronics, and solar energy industries. In addition, the company offers various value added specialty fluoro intermediates consist of boron trifluoride gas and related adducts for pharmaceutical industry, as well as crop protection, hydrocarbon, and fragrance applications; and contract development and contract manufacturing services, such as basic research, library syntheses, process development, scale up, and small and batch manufacturing for custom chemical syntheses of fluorinated compounds in the pharmaceuticals, agro chemicals, and specialty chemicals industries. Navin Fluorine International Limited was founded in 1967 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vishad Padmanabh Mafatlal", "age": 51, "title": "Executive Chairman of the Board", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 98500000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nitin G. Kulkarni", "age": 53, "title": "MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 68300000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anish P. Ganatra", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Radheshyam  Singh", "age": 59, "title": "President of Operations & Site Head of Surat (Gujarat) Manufacturing Facility", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Lalit R. Soni", "title": "Vice President of Corporate Finance & Treasury", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Niraj Bipin Mankad", "age": 56, "title": "President of Legal & Company Secretary", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Partha Roy Chowdhury", "age": 64, "title": "Chief Executive Officer of HPP Business", "yearBorn": 1961, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2592000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. T. N. Nandakumar", "age": 61, "title": "VP & Business Head-International Trade", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajesh  Jain", "title": "Chief Supply Chain Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amish  Kamat", "title": "VP, Corporate Head of HSE & Sustainability", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "executiveTeam": [], "ma